Ye Olde Apothecary is a pharmacy in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], newer than most. It sells potions, cosmetics, foodstuffs, and ordinary medicine to anyone with a doctor's prescription, and keeps no discount for friends of [[Smiler]].
